    <briefdescription>
<para>Constructs Merkle trees over artifact batches and produces/verifies proofs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The implementation uses SHA-256 and canonical JSON serialisation for leaf hashing (compatible with the blockchain_integrity module).</para>
<para>Leaf ordering is deterministic: artifacts are sorted by adapter_id then version before tree construction, ensuring reproducible roots.</para>
<para>Performance contract: <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_i_artifact_merkle_proof_engine_1a16d83b89e2d16dc4478635090d6a388f" kindref="member">buildRoot()</ref> for 1 000 artifacts ≤ 50 ms. verify() is O(log N) where N is batch_size. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
